# CH32X035F8U6 Bootloader & Host Tool Guide

## Pin Configurations
- MCU A1: Boot Pin
- MCU A2 --> Probe RX
- MCU A3 --> Probe TX

## Bootloader Build
From this directory, run:
```bash
make flash_combined
```
This should generate `build/bootloader.bin` and `build/update.bin` (image).

## Host Tool Build
From this directory, run:
```bash
make tool
```
This should generate `pctool.bin` and put it in `/usr/local/bin`.

## Tool Test
Run:
```bash
pctool /dev/ttyACM0 ./build/update.bin
```

Expected Output:
```bash
0x00000000
...
0xFFFFFFFF
Firmware Update Successful
```